Z||000000||RobertVol||01-02-2001||11:38 PM||||Well It has been awhile since I posted about the club. I am sorry guys. I have been VERY busy.But I am back and have a few updates.<P>First if you were there for the initial meeting please e mail me. I need to check my mailing list. I sent an e mail out and got some returns. The reason for this if you remember our little discussion about the "part Bin" and club benefits. I have established a board for that. please get with the me on this. <P>Also plans for next meeting still up in the air. maybe a little more north for the GA crowd? Have not set up the collection meeting for here yet.<P>Would like to send a good representation to Daytona this spring for our region. Any thoughts &gt; please let me know.  We could go together. <P>I also have received more emails for the area so we are getting more interest<P>So guys let me know <P>Also since I have been back and have noticed alot of new members and some hostility lately hmmm whats up with that&gt;? he he  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Forums getting a little "Feisty"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Anyway... Cliff thanks for the space ..<P>Robert is OUT! <BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=819451&a=5959473&p=36934984&Sequence=0"> <P>------------------<BR>Robert<BR>88GT 56k T TOP  <BR>North Florida Fiero Club <A HREF="http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros" TARGET=_blank>http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros</A>||||reg||1
