Z||000010||turbo86se||01-03-2001||08:46 PM||||Hi Robert,<BR>I got your email and checked out your site, just gets better! I'll have to get up in the "Fiero Attic" to see what I've got. It's a lot! <P>As long as it's a Sunday, I should be able to make a meeting soon. Class starts for me next week six days a week. There goes my golf game. My mechanic swears my coupe will be on four wheels this weekend, and the weather is supposed to be nice. Maybe I'll take the T-top coupe down. <P>Once again, I can't make the Daytona trip. I've been trying to go for years now. I'll be in South Beach, Miami the week before for spring break with some friends. Tim, Robert, JoeJoe and Jeff, you are welcome to come up to SC and pick up the turbo! I'll let ya'll fight about who! LOL (Just kidding!!)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Williamsburg is a definite. I'm going to make reservations soon. If it falls on the same week I'm supposed to go to Maine, guess I'm not going to Maine this year! Somehow I'll get both Fieros up there. I may need a volunteer.||||reg||1
